是「针对高危婴儿照护者的公共卫生指南建议用加热到至少 70 ℃（158 ℉）的水冲调配方奶粉以灭活微生物」。早产儿、体重偏低的孩子和不满 2 个月的孩子风险最高。别用保温杯里放了一天的水来冲。也别把冲好的奶搁在室温下，等着下一顿再喂"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-personal-note"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["我的备注"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button"},"children":["写下对自己有用的提醒…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link","href":"/tip/20-04"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-left","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M19 12H5"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["上一条"]},"前 6 个月只喂母乳，连水都不用喂，6 个月起加辅食并继续母乳"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link next","href":"/tip/20-06"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["下一条"]},"不满 1 岁不喂蜂蜜"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M5 12h14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"section","props":{"className":"life-tip-related"},"children":[{"tag":"h2","props":{},"children":["本主题的其他建议"]},{"tag":"ul","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/20-01"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["让婴儿期的孩子仰着睡，睡硬的平面，同房不同床，床上不放任何软东西"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["孩子还是婴儿的时候，让他脸朝上躺着睡，睡在硬的平面上。大人和